  "name": "AI Email Classification",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "= ## AI Email Classification Prompt\n\nYou are an email classification system. Your ONLY job is to classify the email into exactly ONE category.\n\nAllowed categories:\nSales\nSupport\nComplaint\nInvoice\nSpam\nGeneral\n\nFollow these rules:\n\n* SALES: The sender wants to buy something, asks about product/service prices, plans, packages, availability, or purchasing.\n* SUPPORT: The sender needs help with an existing product/service, such as login problems, technical problems, account problems, or how-to questions.\n* COMPLAINT: The sender is unhappy, dissatisfied, reports poor service, damaged products, delays, or a bad experience.\n* INVOICE: The sender asks about an invoice, bill, receipt, payment, transaction, or billing document.\n* SPAM: The email is suspicious, unsolicited, irrelevant, or clearly unwanted promotional content.\n* GENERAL: Use this ONLY when the email does not clearly match any of the five categories above.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n* Choose the category based on the main purpose of the email.\n* Do NOT choose General if the email clearly matches another category.\n* Return ONLY ONE category name.\n* Do not provide an explanation.\n* Do not add punctuation.\n* Do not write \"Category:\".\n\nEmail to classify:\n{{ $json.textPlain }}\n",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
